{"id":"1bb7521b3e7ed5f3","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-unitliteral.md","title":"Unit literal propagation for DNF zero equations","display":"thm-unitliteral — Unit literal propagation for DNF zero equations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-unitliteral","aliases":["27-thm-unitliteral"],"display":"thm-unitliteral — Unit literal propagation for DNF zero equations","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.5.2 Davis–Putnam rules","source_printed_pages":"84,85","source_pdf_pages":"108,109","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-unitliteral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-unitliteral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-unitliteral — Unit literal propagation for DNF zero equations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.5.2 Davis–Putnam rules"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"84,85"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"108,109"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(g:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_b,f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(\\ell_b,f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell_b(a)\\coloneqq b a_i+(1-b)(1-a_i),\\qquad f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\ell_b(a),g(a)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell_b(a)\\coloneqq b a_i+(1-b)(1-a_i),\\qquad f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\ell_b(a),g(a)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=0\\}=\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid a_i=1-b\\land g(a)=0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=0\\}=\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid a_i=1-b\\land g(a)=0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\max\\{a_i,1-a_i,g(a)\\}=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\max\\{a_i,1-a_i,g(a)\\}=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>当 DNF 含单位项 x_i 时，每个零解必须置 x_i=0；含单位项的负文字时必须置 x_i=1。两种单位项同时出现则直接矛盾。第一式保留全部解，而不只是可满足性；其反复应用是书中的单位传播。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_b,f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_b(a)\\coloneqq b a_i+(1-b)(1-a_i),\\qquad f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\ell_b(a),g(a)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=0\\}=\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid a_i=1-b\\land g(a)=0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\max\\{a_i,1-a_i,g(a)\\}=1.","display":true}],"bytes":1546,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-unitliteral|thm-unitliteral — Unit literal propagation for DNF zero equations]]"}],"outgoing":[]}